  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The proposal due to its lack of an adequate visibility splay and as it would be positioned in close proximity to a 90 degree bend in North Hyde Lane, would result in harm to the safety of road and footpath users. The proposed development is therefore not in accordance with policies ENV-B.1.1 (New Development), T.4.4 (Road Safety) and T.5.3 (Vehicle Crossovers and Hardstandings) of the adopted London Borough of Hounslow Unitary Development Plan, and Supplementary Planning Guidance.\r\n\r\nInformative\r\nThe use of this forecourt for car parking involves vehicles crossing the footway. Without a properly constructed crossover this is against the law. The matter has been referred to the Council's Highways Section for further investigation."
